OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAs a heatwave hits Barnsley,
OL,7,     Fpressure increases for sister Jane
OL,8,     Fin casualty. Among those seeking
OL,9,     Femergency treatment are
OL,10,     F65-year-old Theresa, with a
OL,11,     Fpossible stroke.
OL,12,G2100 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FA panicked 911 call had police
OL,14,     Frushing to the scene to find an
OL,15,     Foccupant dead and guns abandoned
OL,16,     Foutside. An undercover Texas
OL,17,     FRanger operation uncovers a
OL,18,     Fshocking conspiracy.
